# Prettier is configured for the JS workspaces only (compiler/wasm,
# tooling/noir_js, tooling/noirc_abi_wasm, etc.).  The workspace-level
# pre-commit hook (`.pre-commit-config.yaml`, generated by
# repo-workspaces / prek) runs prettier on every staged text file —
# including Rust sources, Cargo manifests, and lock files — which
# fails because prettier has no parser for those languages.  This
# ignore file scopes prettier to the file types it actually formats.

# Rust sources and manifests
**/*.rs
**/*.toml
Cargo.lock

# Nix / shell / etc — out of scope for the JS prettier setup
**/*.nix
**/*.sh
**/*.org
**/*.nr

# Compiler-generated artifacts
target/
**/target/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.direnv/

# Self
.prettierignore
.pre-commit-config.yaml
